<meta name="description" content="OFI Update (7/30): Some SNAP households received an extra SNAP payment on their EBT card on Friday, July 31. This payment corrects a previous federal delay in benefit calculation due to utility allowances. If you received an extra payment, a letter was mailed explaining why. Not every SNAP household needed this payment because they already got the right amount of benefits.  " />
